{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01842","headline":"杂曲歌辞 别离曲 · 张籍","name":"杂曲歌辞 别离曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行人结束出门去，马蹏几时踏门路。\n忆昔君初纳彩时，不言身属辽阳戍。\n早知今日当别离，成君家计良爲谁。\n男儿生身自有役，那得悞我少年时。\n不如逐君征战死，谁能独老空闺里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}